<title>AUSTRIA: Boehler-Uddeholm details H1 results.</title>
<headline>Boehler-Uddeholm details H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending June 1 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     H1 96	 H1 95</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				778.7  vs   696.3</p>
<p>    Group net				    552.9  vs   596.8</p>
<p>Group earnings before interest</p>
<p>    and tax (EBIT)			     919.2  vs   718.7</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			  1,009.5  vs 1,076.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Boehler-Uddeholm AG. It is 25 percent owned by the Austrian government.</p>
<p>    Group sales				9,339    vs 9,221</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		  5,028    vs 6,842</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		   3,135    vs 4,589</p>
<p>    Group investment			   363.6  vs   270.9</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   9,636   vs  10,297</p>
</text>
